# ============================================================
# Boba Dash — Cursor AI Rules
# Project: Bubble Tea Time-Management Game (Overseas Edition)
# ============================================================

## Project Overview
- **Name**: Boba Dash
- **Type**: Time-management cooking game (Bubble Tea theme)
- **Platform**: React Native (Expo) → iOS + Android native app
- **Backend**: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Edge Functions + RLS)
- **Architecture**: RN Shell + WebView Canvas Game + Supabase Backend
- **Language**: TypeScript (shared) + JavaScript (H5 game)

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: Expo SDK 51, React Native 0.74, React 18.2
- **Navigation**: @react-navigation/bottom-tabs
- **Backend**: Supabase JS v2 (@supabase/supabase-js)
- **WebView**: react-native-webview (loads H5 Canvas game)
- **Storage**: AsyncStorage (offline) + Supabase (cloud sync)
- **IAP**: RevenueCat (planned)
- **Auth**: Supabase Auth (Apple + Google OAuth)

## Architecture Pattern: Offline-First
- Game is **always playable offline** (single-player mode)
- Auth is **optional** — enables social features when connected
- Data flow: Save → AsyncStorage (instant) → Supabase (background sync)
- Storage abstraction: `HybridStorage` class in `shared/storage.ts`
- Never block the game loop on network calls

